        "statement": "This is a pre-upgrade check in the 0.16 upgrade guide. If any of the four CRDs still lists v1alpha1 in status.storedVersions, the check reports \"NOT SAFE! REMOVE v1alpha1 FROM YOUR STORED VERSIONS\", and v1alpha1 must be removed from the stored versions before upgrading. In 0.16.0 the chart's CRDs no longer include v1alpha1.",
